UNIT.learningOutcomes:
By the end of the sub-strand, the learner should be able to:
a) illustrate chemical bonding in common compounds;
b) identify bond types in common compounds;
c) distinguish structures of selected elements and compounds;
d) describe the relationship between the bond types and the physical properties of elements and compounds;
e) select appropriate materials for use based on bond type and structure;
f) reflect on the appropriateness of substances used in day-to-day life.
